'''Tobi-chan''' (Japanese: '''とびちゃん''') is one of the [[Ghost Master]]s located in the [[Sealed Fort]], located on [[GR Island]] in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game 2: The Invasion of Team GR!]] Tobi-chan can be found in the fifth of the nine statues in the main room. Players who defeat Tobi-chan will obtain a Present Pack, which can consist of any card that can be found in a booster pack in the game.

==Poison Storm Deck==
'''Poison Storm Deck''' (Japanese: '''ポイズンストームデッキ''') is the deck played by Tobi-chan. The deck consists mainly of {{e|Grass}} and {{e|Fire}} Pokémon.

